// Package dictionary: activity bonus (PA, wave 4, W4-PPA).
//
// Phase 0: sources only. Modules arrive with the prompt-П cycle:
//   02-droit (L. 842-1/2/5, L. 843-2, R. 842-2 timing boundary),
//   03-montant (L. 842-3 formula, D. 843-1 scales, D. 843-2 bonification,
//     D. 843-3 fraction, D. 843-4 minimum, R. 843-1 trimestre),
//   04-recouvrement (L. 845-3/4/5; pf-core L. 553-1/2 imports),
//   05-devoirs (L. 843-1 service, L. 844-1 accompaniment, L. 845-1/2
//     control, L. 845-6 intermediary).
// FINISH pa adds 06-ouverture (R. 842-1..5, R. 843-2, D. 846-1/3),
// 07-ressources (R. 844-1/2/4/5, R. 845-1/2/3), 08-service (D. 846-2,
// R. 846-1..9), 09-recours (D. 847-1/2/3, R. 847-1/1-1/2/3) and
// 10-statistiques (D. 848-1..5, R. 848-1); fragments pending
// generation (GENERATED_OUTPUT_PENDING).
// Session 3 (08.10.2026) adds 11-forfait-chaine (the single-person forfait by
// MONTH from the pinned decrees 2020-491 ... 2026-222 and the L. 161-25
// coefficient chain, built and checked, DECISION-0452; generated by
// tools/build_forfait_chaine.py) and 12-forfait-logement (R. 844-3 forfait and
// R. 844-4 I aid cap, resources of the month for the L. 842-3 2 floor).
//
// DEONTIC MAP OVER PINNED TEXTS ONLY (bytes of 01-sources.law; outside
// them — boundary, not conjecture). Full map with the modules.
//
// Euro base forfait and L. 161-25 coefficient: RESOLVED (11-forfait-chaine; a
// case-supplied forfait_base_retenu still prevails; the rounding of the product
// is the reading ForfaitRevalorisationArrondiCentime, D-82). Resource mechanics:
// boundary B-PPA-RESSOURCES-CALCUL (see tools/build_sources.py DECLARED_GAPS).
// B-PPA-SMIC-MOIS: the hourly SMIC (D. 843-2/4 multiples) is a retained monthly
// fact (smic_horaire_retenu) from the pinned series of fr.travail.smic; a rule
// cannot evaluate another package at a reference month other than the legal time
// of the case. B-PPA-FL-MENAGE-AL: the persons excluded from the housing-aid
// household (R. 844-4 I al. 2) are not modelled. Worlds below contain only this
// package plus fr.smic (SMIC multiples in D. 843-2/4).

language "law.core" version "0.2";
package fr.css.prime_activite version "0.1.0";
namespace "urn:fr:corpus:clir:ppa";
